CorvCAD patch series for KiCad 10.0.6 (caf7377), on top of 0003: drop unused libgit2 and
curl includes from model files.

Applied by integrations/kicad_core/fetch.py. No behaviour change.

1. common/project.cpp includes <git2.h> but calls nothing from libgit2 (its git query goes
   through KIGIT::PROJECT_GIT_UTILS).
2. common/http_lib/http_lib_connection.cpp includes <curl/curl.h> but only uses
   KICAD_CURL_EASY.
diff --git a/common/http_lib/http_lib_connection.cpp b/common/http_lib/http_lib_connection.cpp
index 01962d04..03d69661 100644
--- a/common/http_lib/http_lib_connection.cpp
+++ b/common/http_lib/http_lib_connection.cpp
@@ -28,7 +28,6 @@
 #include <wx/base64.h>
 
 #include <kicad_curl/kicad_curl_easy.h>
-#include <curl/curl.h>
 
 #include <http_lib/http_lib_connection.h>
 #include <lib_id.h>
diff --git a/common/project.cpp b/common/project.cpp
index 730cddbd..765b0255 100644
--- a/common/project.cpp
+++ b/common/project.cpp
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@
 #include <lockfile.h>
 #include <macros.h>
 #include <git/project_git_utils.h>
-#include <git2.h>
 #include <project.h>
 
 #include <footprint_library_adapter.h>
